id: STYLE-036
ilities: [modifiability]
source: cpm
maturity: 4
action: advisory
title: Closing brace comments (code smell for too-long blocks)
category: style
severity: info
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .js .jsx .tsx .java .kt .cs .go .c .cpp .h
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
patterns:
  - regex: \}\s*//\s*(end|endif|endfor|endwhile|end if|end for|end while|end class|end function|end method)
    message: "Closing brace comment — indicates the block is too long to see its opening. Extract to a function."
fix: If you need a comment to find the matching brace, the block is too long. Extract to a named function.
